<div class="truncated_thumbnail_holder thumbnail_small thumbnail_featured_image" style="display:inline; float:right"><span class="rendered_qtext"><div class="ui_qtext_image_outer"><div class="qtext_image_wrapper"><img class="landscape qtext_image zoomable_in zoomable_in_feed" src="none" style="-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic; outline:0; text-decoration:none; border:0; max-width:200px; margin-left:10px; border-style:none; float:left; margin-right:5px; max-height:100px; float: left;" alt="image" /></div></div></span></div>
<span class="rendered_qtext"><p class="qtext_para" style="margin:1em 0; line-height:1.6; display:inline"><b style="font-weight:400">Amazon offices, circa 2018.</b></p>
<p class="qtext_para" style="margin:1em 0; line-height:1.6; display:inline"><b style="font-weight:400">Me: </b>Hey, Will, does Sarah (<i>my manager</i>) give two shits about what we code in?</p>
